### =========================================================================
### Task Management API — HTTP Client Test Scenarios
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

### 1. HEALTH CHECK
GET http://localhost:8080/health
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


### =========================================================================
### 2. AUTHENTICATION MODULE
### =========================================================================

### 2.1. Register User (Success)
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Khoirir Rosikin",
  "email": "khoirir.rosikin@gmail.com",
  "password": "secretpassword123"
}

### 2.2. Register User (Duplicate Email - Expected 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Khoirir Rosikin",
  "email": "khoirir.rosikin@gmail.com",
  "password": "secretpassword123"
}

### 2.3. Login User (Success)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "khoirir.rosikin@gmail.com",
  "password": "secretpassword123"
}

### Ambil token dari response login di atas
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 2.4. Login User (Wrong Password - Expected 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "khoirir.rosikin@gmail.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}


### =========================================================================
### 3. PROJECT MODULE
### =========================================================================

### 3.1. Create Project (Success)
# @name createProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Task Management Project",
  "description": "Building a robust Task Management API with Go and PostgreSQL"
}

### Ambil ID project yang baru dibuat
@projectId = {{createProject.response.body.data.id}}

### 3.2. Create Project (Validation Error - Expected 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": ""
}

### 3.3. List Projects (Success)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3.4. Get Project by ID (Success)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3.5. Update Project (Success)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Task Management API (Updated)",
  "description": "Updated project description with complete features"
}


### =========================================================================
### 4. TASK MODULE
### =========================================================================

### 4.1. Create Task 1 - Todo / High Priority (Success)
# @name createTask1
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Design Database Schema",
  "description": "Create goose migrations for users, projects, and tasks",
  "status": "todo",
  "priority": "high",
  "due_date": "2026-10-15T18:00:00Z"
}

### Ambil Task ID yang baru dibuat
@taskId = {{createTask1.response.body.data.id}}

### 4.2. Create Task 2 - In Progress / Medium Priority
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Implement Unit Tests",
  "description": "Write service and handler unit tests with testify/mock",
  "status": "in_progress",
  "priority": "medium"
}

### 4.3. Create Task (Validation Error - Title Terlalu Pendek / Kosong)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "A",
  "status": "todo"
}

### 4.4. List Tasks by Project (Success)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4.5. Get Task by ID (Success)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4.6. Update Task - Ubah Status ke Completed (Success)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Design Database Schema (Done)",
  "status": "completed",
  "priority": "urgent"
}

### 4.7. Update Task (Validation Error - Status Tidak Valid)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "status": "pending_approval"
}

### 4.8. Delete Task (Success)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4.9. Get Deleted Task (Expected 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### =========================================================================
### 5. CLEANUP / DELETE PROJECT
### =========================================================================

### 5.1. Delete Project (Success)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5.2. Get Deleted Project (Expected 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### =========================================================================
### 6. SECURITY & UNAUTHORIZED SCENARIOS
### =========================================================================

### 6.1. Access Protected Route Without Token (Expected 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects

### 6.2. Access Protected Route With Invalid/Tampered Token (Expected 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer invalid_jwt_token_here
